==Description==

L'outil [[Image:Assembly_CreateSnapshot.svg|24px]] [[Assembly_CreateSnapshot/fr|Assembly Instantané]] permet de sauvegarder l'état en cours de l'assemblage (positionnement et visibilité). Un double-clic sur l'objet Snapshot permet de rétablir cet état dans l'assemblage.

<span id="Usage"></span>
==Utilisation==

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
# Make sure that an assembly is active.
# There are several ways to invoke the tool:
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Assembly_CreateSnapshot.svg|16px]] [[Assembly_CreateSnapshot|Snapshot]]}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Assembly → [[Image:Assembly_CreateSnapshot.svg|16px]] Snapshot}} option from the menu.
# If no Snapshot object pre-exists: A '''Snapshots''' container is added to the active assembly.
# A '''Snapshot''' object containing a capture of the current assembly state is added to the Snapshot container.
# Optionally double-click any available Snapshot object to restore its stored assembly state.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
==Notes==
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
Snapshot objects are permanently inactive (grayed out) ignoring the Visibility property.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
==Properties==
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
See also: [[Property_View|Property View]].
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
===Snapshots===
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
A '''Snapshots''' container is an {{Incode|Assembly::SnapshotGroup}} object which is derived from an [[App_DocumentObjectGroup|App DocumentObjectGroup]] object and inherits all its properties. It has no additional properties.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
===Snapshot===
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
A '''Simulation''' object is derived from an [[App_FeaturePython|App FeaturePython]] object and inherits all its properties. It also has the following additional properties:
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
====Data====
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
{{Properties_Title|Snapshot}}
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* {{PropertyData|Components|LinkList}}: List of components captured in this snapshot.
* {{PropertyData|Placements|PlacementList}}: List of corresponding placements for the components.
* {{PropertyData|Solve On Action|Boole}}: If true, applying the snapshot will solve the assembly after restoring the placements.
* {{PropertyData|Visibilities|BooleList}}: List of visibility states for the components.
</div>


